OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cloudy but dry start to the
OL,6,Fweekend. Mist, fog and cloud all
OL,7,Fclearing by the afternoon, with sunny
OL,8,Fspells to follow. Light winds,
OL,9,Fbreezier along the coast.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FClear to start the evening
OL,12,Fbut clouding over with outbreaks of
OL,13,Frain and drizzle overnight. The wind
OL,14,Fremains light throughout.
OL,15,
OL,16,CSunday:FRain and drizzle will clear
OL,17,Fduring the morning, with bright and
OL,18,Fsunny spells developing during the
OL,19,Fafternoon. Feeling cooler compared
OL,20,Fwith Saturday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
